WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.969
KINGO
Do you know why I love movies?

00:00:06.899 --> 00:00:07.805
The fans.

00:00:08.949 --> 00:00:10.636
(And the fans have spoken.)

00:00:15.078 --> 00:00:15.749
AJAK
Hell yes.

00:00:16.256 --> 00:00:20.103
(Don't miss the film that
will change the Marvel universe forever.)

00:00:20.154 --> 00:00:21.435
PHASTOS
Wait 'til you see this.

00:00:21.803 --> 00:00:23.498
KINGO
That's really good marketing material.

00:00:25.053 --> 00:00:26.156
JACK
Can we go to space too?

00:00:26.207 --> 00:00:27.023
PHASTOS
Let's wait 'til you

00:00:27.074 --> 00:00:28.212
get your learners permit, ok?

